Subject: [PATCH 1/2] kosmickrisp: add KK_COMPILE_LOG for shader and pipeline
 compile times

KK_COMPILE_LOG logs shader compiles, Metal render pipeline builds, pipeline
cache loads and the write-mask and tile pipelines built at draw time
when they take over 5 ms, with the calling thread, a per-second total
per kind, and the threads that submit to the queue.

